        <p>The above are extremely good in quality and will be quickly sold out. Also about 18 doz. ladies' fancy embroidered Handkerchiefs, Usual price 7id each, Sale price 31d each. 15 dozen very fine Inch cambric Handkerchiefs. Usuai price 4s 6d per d,,zeu, bale price 2s 3ct per dozen or is 3d, per half-dc zen. Upwards of 3000 yards of Ribbons, various kinds. Upwards of 2COO yards Fall . its. 65 Dozen bilk Hankerchiefs, Silk Squares, &amp;c. 350 Blouses, Shirts, &amp;c., including one special lot of 7± Silk Blouses. All one price 7s 6d each. 144 Check Flannellette Blouses is 619.1 each. 4 SSHAWLS.-125 wool Shawls and wool Wraps marked is 6d to 108 6d. Some splendid bargains ill this lot. OOLEN UN DERCLOTHIN G.—The entire Fitock V of Hosiery, Woollen Underclothing, and Planneilette Underclothing marked at a substantial reduction. , nORSETS.-Our splendid stock of Corsets (' reatly reduced, Including a special lot of 50 pairs, to to, add at is 9i per pair. DRZSSING GOWNS.-25 ladieq' Dressing Owns of various kinds, from Sc ed each. t UNDER SKIRTS.—About 75 silk lir ()loth Skirts of various kinds. Many of thee areneft.r7ydhalf- price .</p>
        <p>UMBRELLAS AND SUNSHADES, ALL GRE.V2LT I.EDUCE.D. • VANS.—About 50 high-class Fans, `irom 18 lid; I: ordinary price 4s 6d to 17s 6d esen. These are new goods and are exceptionally cheap. •</p>
        <p>GLOVE DEPAR TM ENT. The entire stock of Kid and Fabric Gloves at substotial reductions. c shall offer an Agents' Stock, consisting of neatly' 2000 pairs of samples of coloured and black Kid Gloves, In various qualities, at is 3d, is 6d stud is 110. perpair. The quality is the same as our regular goods at is lid, 2s 11d, and 3s. 61 per pair. TRAVELLING TRUNKS.—A /umber of 61. a- d, stone Bags, Traye7ling Trunks, &amp;T., will be sold* very cheap. TILLINERY DP-T A R MENT. ;•-z</p>
