        <p>BLIND, nearly dead Poultry and Pigeons cureil 'by HOLDEN'S Roup Cure Pills. Truth. no cram.—seel testi- monials. Deli% e:ea, free t 9, 15, or 21 stamps, HOLDEN, Chemist, Barnsley.</p>
