        <p>ANNUAL REDUCTrON.</p>
        <p>15 PER CENT. FROM USUAL PRICES DURING THE WHOLE OF JANUARY. A POPULAR CONCESSION.</p>
        <p>REAT BRITAIN'S ISOLATION.</p>
        <p>The desire of foreigners to make political capital out.of l:111 insults offered to.this country, has been largely discounte' by the formation of the Flying Squadron. The energy played by the War Office and the Admiralty has nipped,“' the bud the growing impertinence of our envious eomPew tors. The competition in trade by Great Britain in all the markets of the world is perhaps the secret cause of foreign hate. Nothing arouses envy so much as successful or/IFt° tion in business. Great Britain is the most successful of S% the traders of the earth, hence the screeching of her enemid. A parallel case exist in this city of Manchester. Worsleyrth. Greatest House Furnisher in the North of England and olle of the most successful competitors in the trade of this great city, is the subject of envy and jealousy amongst his would' be competitors. Worsley's reply,to these jealous competitor. is to organise a Flying Squadron of Marvellons Barash* which will obliterate and pulverise any possible</p>
        <p>THE FLYING SQUADRON OF BARGAINS IS now ON VIEW AT ORSLEY'S BIG SALIg,</p>
        <p>"THE PATHEON." GAYTHOEN, MANCHESTER,</p>
        <p>Is filled to overflowing with countless and innurnerabl hosts of Wonderful and Extraordinary Bargains. The vasV building of the Pantheon is open to all for inspection. Yod can walk in with perfect freedom, inspect the stock, please yourself whether you buy or not. All requiring cheap lots 10 furnishing should inspect Worsley's bete, e deciding. We in- vite comparison of prices, quantity, and quality.</p>
        <p>WAD ON OF BARGAINS GREAT _0 g WONDERFUL. EPITOME OF BARGAINb IN HOUSES OF FURNITURE. For £l5; usual price, £2O. A smart House of Furniture, con- sisting of the whole of the Furniture for 3 Rooms, the Sitting-room having,Solid Mahogany or Walnut Furni- ture ; the Bedroom containing a Bedroom Suite corn pieta; also Solid Brass and Enamel Bedstead, complete with all the Bedding, ac. The Kitchen is also fur- nished complete, besides Hall, Stairs, Landing, and Scullery. Everything is as good as new, and cost over £4O not six months ago. A full detailed list will be sent post free on application. For £25; usual price, £35. A magnificent House of Porn!' ture, removed from Sale, co.:t £7O. for 4 Rooms. Par ticular. on application. For £4O, cost £95. A grand House of Furniture, mostli made by Ogden, in splendid oonclition, equal to new; one of the gems; the best bargain ever offered hi Worsley's. Contains furniture for dining-room, dravr lug-room, and three bedrooms, besides kitchen; the sundries are worth £lO. Suites t every room. Th! furniture can be guaranteed throughout, being all 50110 and well made. Send for full detailed list. For £6O. Complete House of Furniture. This lot is defaulter's house of furniture, which we supplied on tit deferred payment system, but which contract was never completed. It was a bargain in the first instance, hi° is doubly so now. The dining-room is furnished err tirely in solid brown oak, the drawing-room is Ch/P: pendale mahogany, the best bedroona in solid walnut' and burr, the visitors' bedroom in satinwood. Ths kitchen servants' bedrooms are nicely furnished, eh° besides there are the pictures, curtains, blinds, star dries, ac., also the best carpets and oilcloths througli out. The whole lot for £6O ; cheap at £l2O. bend once for a complete detailed hat of this lot to Worslieje For 100 Guineas. The Best Complete House of Furnitiole. Manchester for this price, or even double this P "tio Worsley's in this lot offer all the heavy, substeo9o furniture, removed from Brooklands, for the guineas, and will undertake to supply new carpets linoleum throughout without making any additiolo" charge for this lot, The furniture is worth double the, amount, still, whoever buys this lot may have perfeew freedom in selection of carpets and linoleum. _The furniture is for dining, drawing, sitting, and We' bedrooms. Send for the complete list, when you Ole better judge of the most extraordinary bargain eve offered.</p>
        <p>- The above form the Ist Division of the Flying Squadron °1 wonderful bargains mobilise.' at " The Pantheon."</p>
