        <p>EALE'S GOUT &amp; RHEUMATIC PILLS</p>
        <p>B FFERED AGONY FOR THIRTY YEARS.</p>
        <p>'3O, Randall Street, Bridge Road, Battersea, S.W., January 27,1892. " Dear Sir,—l feel it my duty to write and give you great praise for introducing such a valuable medicine as your Gout Pills.</p>
